name=Sensible Refrigeration (ZombieBuddy)
id=SensibleRefrigerationZB
description=Optional add-on for Sensible Refrigeration. Needs the ZombieBuddy Java mod loader. Stops the game thawing frozen food that sits in cold air, so it no longer briefly thaws while its container is open. Enable it alongside Sensible Refrigeration; without ZombieBuddy, use Sensible Refrigeration alone.
require=SensibleRefrigeration,ZombieBuddy
loadModAfter=SensibleRefrigeration,ZombieBuddy
